---
// apps/docs/src/components/ArchitectureSection.astro
---

<section class="py-16 md:py-20 border-t border-slate-800/80">
  <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/20 text-purple-400 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
      Headless vs Monolithic
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">
      Why Headless Project Management?
    </h2>
    <p class="text-slate-400 mt-3 text-sm md:text-base">
      Traditional project trackers force you into their web UI, vendor lock-in, and costly per-seat pricing. Critical Path gives you the raw engine to embed directly into your stack.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <!-- Monolithic Column -->
    <div class="p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950/40 border border-rose-900/30 relative">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 text-rose-400 font-mono text-sm">
        <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500"></span>
        Traditional Monoliths (Jira, Asana, Monday)
      </div>
      <ul class="space-y-3.5 text-sm text-slate-400">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
          <span class="text-rose-400 select-none">&times;</span>
          <span><strong>Rigid UI:</strong> Locked into third-party dashboards and iframe embeds.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
          <span class="text-rose-400 select-none">&times;</span>
          <span><strong>Siloed Data:</strong> Your project data lives in their proprietary cloud database.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
          <span class="text-rose-400 select-none">&times;</span>
          <span><strong>Per-Seat Tax:</strong> Exponential enterprise billing for every internal user.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
          <span class="text-rose-400 select-none">&times;</span>
          <span><strong>Slow Latency:</strong> Multi-second roundtrips across bloated external REST APIs.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Critical Path Column -->
    <div class="p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900/90 to-slate-950 border border-sky-500/30 shadow-xl shadow-sky-500/5 relative">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 text-sky-400 font-mono text-sm">
        <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-sky-400 animate-ping"></span>
        The Critical Path Way
      </div>
      <ul class="space-y-3.5 text-sm text-slate-300">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
          <span class="text-sky-400 select-none">&check;</span>
          <span><strong>100% Custom UX:</strong> Render natively in your own React or Svelte design system.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
          <span class="text-sky-400 select-none">&check;</span>
          <span><strong>Your Database:</strong> Store tasks in your SQLite or Firestore instance alongside your application data.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
          <span class="text-sky-400 select-none">&check;</span>
          <span><strong>MIT Open Source:</strong> Zero per-seat fees. Deploy everywhere with complete source control.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
          <span class="text-sky-400 select-none">&check;</span>
          <span><strong>Sub-Millisecond Engine:</strong> In-process topological sorting and instant critical path math.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
